---
const cover = "/images/projects/thumbnail1.jpeg";
---

<article class="fieldnotes-project">
  <header class="opening">
    <div class="topline">
      <a class="back-link" href="/work/">← All projects</a>
      <span>Independent study / 2026</span>
    </div>

    <div class="headline">
      <p class="eyebrow">A study in digital atmosphere</p>
      <h1>Make room<br />for the <em>unexpected.</em></h1>
      <p class="intro">
        A playful exploration of how image, type, and quiet moments can turn a
        simple web experience into somewhere worth spending time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="cover">
      <img src={cover} alt="Visual direction for the creative project" fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption>01 / The first impression</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="project-facts">
      <div>
        <span class="fact-label">ROLE</span>
        <span>Art direction, design & development</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="fact-label">TOOLS</span>
        <span>Astro / CSS / JavaScript</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="fact-label">YEAR</span>
        <span>2026</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <span class="section-number">01 — The idea</span>
    <div>
      <h2>Less interface.<br /><span>More feeling.</span></h2>
      <p>
        The starting point was a question: what if a portfolio felt less like a
        catalogue and more like opening a sketchbook? The answer became a
        deliberately loose composition, where every pause and shift in scale
        helps tell the story.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="side-note">Designed to feel discovered, not assembled.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="interlude" aria-label="Project note">
    <span class="asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
    <p>Good rhythm comes from knowing when to<br />break the grid.</p>
    <span class="interlude-credit">A note from the process</span>
  </section>

  <section class="process">
    <div class="process-image">
      <img src={cover} alt="A closer look at the project's visual language" loading="lazy" />
      <span>02 / In the details</span>
    </div>
    <div class="process-copy">
      <span class="section-number">02 — Making it real</span>
      <h2>A little structure.<br />A lot of room.</h2>
      <p>
        Astro keeps the experience lightweight, while custom CSS gives each
        moment its own character. Rather than reaching for a row of reusable
        section templates, the page is composed around its story: one oversized
        opening, an editorial pause, then a closer look at the craft.
      </p>
      <p>
        The result is responsive without becoming uniform. The composition
        shifts for smaller screens, keeping the same sense of contrast and
        breathing room instead of simply shrinking the desktop layout.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="ending">
    <p class="eyebrow">End of this chapter</p>
    <a class="next-link" href="/work/">
      <span>Back to all projects</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </footer>
</article>

<style>
  .fieldnotes-project {
    --paper: #e8e9df;
    --ink: #19332f;
    --rust: #c24e34;
    margin: -8rem calc(-1 * var(--gutter)) -4rem;
    padding: 2rem clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 6rem) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }

  .opening {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .topline {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .back-link {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .headline {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(5rem, 13vw, 11rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-number,
  .fact-label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--rust);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .headline h1 {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 12.5vw, 11rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.82;
    letter-spacing: -0.085em;
  }

  .headline h1 em {
    color: var(--rust);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 390px;
    margin: 0 0 0 auto;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .cover {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cover img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(300px, 62vw, 760px);
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: saturate(0.78);
  }

  .cover figcaption,
  .process-image > span {
    display: block;
    padding-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .project-facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 0.5fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  }

  .project-facts > div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .fact-label {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
  }

  .manifesto {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: clamp(7rem, 15vw, 14rem) auto;
  }

  .manifesto h2,
  .process-copy h2 {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
  }

  .manifesto h2 span {
    color: var(--rust);
  }

  .manifesto > div > p,
  .process-copy > p {
    max-width: 560px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .side-note {
    max-width: 160px;
    margin: 5rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    transform: rotate(4deg);
  }

  .interlude {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    padding: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 11rem) 1rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .asterisk {
    color: #e8a17e;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .interlude p {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .interlude-credit {
    color: #c8c9bc;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .process {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: clamp(7rem, 15vw, 14rem) auto;
  }

  .process-image {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .process-image img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 700px;
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 0.82;
    filter: saturate(0.65);
  }

  .process-copy h2 {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  }

  .ending {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0 clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    border-top: 1px solid currentColor;
  }

  .next-link {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .next-link span:last-child {
    color: var(--rust);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.65em;
    transition: transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .next-link:hover span:last-child {
    transform: translate(0.2em, -0.2em);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .fieldnotes-project {
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    .topline {
      font-size: 0.58rem;
    }

    .headline {
      padding-top: 5rem;
    }

    .headline h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 15vw, 7rem);
    }

    .intro {
      margin: 2rem 0 0;
    }

    .project-facts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }

    .manifesto {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-block: 6rem;
    }

    .manifesto h2,
    .process-copy h2 {
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 13vw, 6rem);
    }

    .side-note {
      justify-self: end;
      margin: 0 1rem 0 0;
    }

    .interlude p br {
      display: none;
    }

    .process {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
      margin-block: 6rem;
    }

    .process-image img {
      max-height: 500px;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
    }

    .next-link {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 11vw, 5rem);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .next-link span:last-child {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
